 - Allergens are the 14 EU allergens, stored lowercase and sorted.
+
+## API access and audit
+
+Schema 3 adds `apiKeys` (key, name, role) and `audit` arrays. Migration
+retains existing data and initializes missing arrays empty; configure keys in
+an existing data file before using the API. Audit entries record successful
+HTTP changes with their time, key name, method, path and response status.
